direction: right

Traffic: 线上流量
Traffic -> Adaptive Compute

Adaptive Compute: {
  style.stroke: "#2563eb"
  style.bold: true
  
  Low Traffic: 低峰期\n(Spare Compute) {
    style.stroke: "#16a34a"
    action: Quota ↑
    result: Better Recommendation\n(榨干闲置算力)
    
    action -> result
  }
  
  Peak Traffic: 高峰期\n(Compute Pressure) {
    style.stroke: "#f59e0b"
    action: Quota ↓
    result: Graceful Degradation\n(保命防雪崩)
    
    action -> result
  }
}
